From 6766c5f47abc4b4df1ccfe0c31355c0fadde8e69 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: JDPG8710 <j565718319@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 10 Sep 2026 14:29:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix: child-safety compliance (parental gate, ads, CN safe
 mode, arena)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implement R1–R8 from the 2026-09-10 compliance engineering requirements:
age-band profiles, shared nickname filter, ParentalGate for ads/checkout/cloud/arena,
child-directed ad HTML tags with consent+gate load gating, Purchases terms and
checkout confirmation, CN_SAFE_MODE defaults, arena report/block + public match
restrictions, curriculum claim scrubbing, tests and docs/updates changelog.
